# A first turn of a mate in 2 that does not win by force (Kd1-e1 in "Small step", third row of the third column at (1124, 346)): the proof
# finds a defence, Black plays it on the board, and "Not quite - Black has a defence" shows before the puzzle resets itself.
wait 20
click 150 370        # Puzzles
wait 40
click 1124 346       # Small step
wait 40
clicksq 0 2 d1
wait 20
clicksq 0 2 e1
wait 60
click 632 90         # Submit
move 880 740
wait 5
waitai
